 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=49Y8epvF5jIQ7kNvwH4AF6l&_nc_oc=AdqjYYZ13CxGLV2GHP7lKLHHA_qNVeBuofm2MabYmLRRew2FaaLA5LAiKoCkTeIsQzk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRa6jR-qrMzQ_88pSZCYYe0c2h0ySMsmqBrlPTPsMmRpw&oe=6B071954"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aadY4_5SktQQ7kNvwGzOhXl&_nc_oc=AdqbTPIqgs_NQej63X45uwp1snMpgncBjw2lISmcHoqmP4wikQxRwmAL9h21bZoYgUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSiCxhUHDJKw_4fEwTzVlcBa713Bf1iE4TcMzUq7C3vhQ&oe=6B070F9D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M3WDSqYEcmUQ7kNvwFxLay-&_nc_oc=AdrDe3tvpE9Is37rCt7KPzpOnA0LGWbm6xPy_dpcsZSOLa0yBoHcm4pGERCHjFeZTgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSSBt3lmAYTVgqq6CRcCK8oqYyxpjTf3Wbv5MhaaLn9NA&oe=6B0703B4"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2